# SiteAgent web product

- SiteAgent is the whole product; the Builder is one workspace inside it.
- `/` is home, `/builder` is the Builder, and `/siteagent` redirects there.
- Keep privileged OpenClaw and Sprite runtime code out of this repository.
- Never expose Sprite, OpenClaw, model, or signing secrets to browser code.
- Preserve unrelated working-tree changes and verify real routes and builds.
